/Write a program to enter many values and sum them, stop when 0 is entered.
/用一个记事本，记录直接input进ac里的值。如果input = ac = 0，就stop
/遇到 0 停止后，只输出最终的总和
Loop,   Input
        Store Tem
        Load Sum
        Add Tem
        Store Sum
        Jns Check
        Jump Loop

Check,  dec 0
        Load Tem
        SkipCond 400
        JumpI Check
        Load Sum
        Output
        Halt

Tem,    dec 0
Sum,    dec 0